# Amun Smart Contract Audit Reports

## Overview

This folder contains historical public smart contract audit materials completed by Softstack for Amun.

Amun was known for crypto index products, structured digital asset products, and tokenized exposure to crypto assets. This makes the folder a useful historical reference for Softstack’s work around tokenized asset infrastructure and smart contract systems connected to crypto investment products.

## Audit Information

Project: Amun  
Audit type: Smart contract audit and certificate  
Repository category: Historical public audit archive  
Public report status: Available in this folder  
Project status: Public activity may have changed after audit completion  

